Hi fellow 'hackers...

I downloaded the '386 executables from wuarchive the other day and I
finally got around to setting it up last night.  I set my HACKDIR in
the nethack.cnf file to d:\games\nh31 and my levels and save to
d:\games\nh31\bones.  Then I made the bones directory and copied all
level files (*.lev) to the bones directory.  OK - now it's time for
the first game - with hands trembling in anticipation, I descend to
level 4 of the dungeon.  Suddenly, I get a message saying that the game
can't find the file minefill.lev (I think that's it), and that the game 
is probably unstable and I should quit.

My question - are there any other files that should be in the levels 
directory in order for all of this to work?  In the meantime I guess I'll
just have to play it all from one directory.  Great game, BTW.

